<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Liverpool upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Liverpool upped to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Sebastian Barry-Taylor raised his rating on Mexican retailer El Puerto de Liverpool SA de CV to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a July 28 report, he said second-quarter results had been above expectations.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed Monday at 8.72 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
